    section1Body: "For larger groups, we divide guests into batches so the tying stays organised even when people arrive at different times. One coordinator keeps the queue moving without rushing anyone.",
    section2Title: "How to book",
    section2Body: "To book, share your event date, exact venue, total headcount and any outfit or décor references. We'll confirm artist availability and recommend a realistic package within one conversation.",
    section3Title: "Who usually books this",
